      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [
          "I\u2019m really glad we could get the recovery opportunity and task in place quickly.  ",
          "I understand how frustrating the recent issues have been, and I want to be as transparent as possible about the concrete steps we\u2019ll take to turn this around.",
          "",
          "| What we\u2019re doing | Why it matters | How it helps you |",
          "|------------------|----------------|------------------|",
          "| **Root\u2011cause analysis** \u2013 We\u2019ll run a full audit of the incidents you reported, identify the underlying system or process gaps, and document a clear action plan. | Gives you a concrete map of what went wrong and how we\u2019ll fix it. | You\u2019ll see the exact fixes, not just \u201cwe\u2019ll improve.\u201d |",
          "| **Dedicated account manager** \u2013 I\u2019ll be your single point of contact for all recovery work. | Eliminates the \u201cmultiple hands\u201d problem that often leads to miscommunication. | Faster response times and a clear escalation path. |",
          "| **Service\u2011level guarantees** \u2013 We\u2019ll set a new SLA for the affected services (e.g., 99.9\u202f% uptime, 4\u202fh mean time to resolution). | Provides measurable, enforceable expectations. | You can benchmark our performance against the promise. |",
          "| **Monthly health check\u2011ins** \u2013 A 30\u2011minute call every month to review metrics, upcoming changes, and any new concerns. | Keeps the conversation open and proactive. | You\u2019ll know we\u2019re actively monitoring and improving. |",
          "| **Compensation / credit** \u2013 We\u2019ll offer a 10\u202f% service credit for the next billing cycle, contingent on the agreed\u2011upon SLA being met for 90\u202fdays. | Demonstrates our confidence in the fixes and gives you a tangible benefit. | Reduces your cost while we prove reliability. |",
          "",
          "### Next steps",
          "",
          "1. **Confirm the list above** \u2013 If there\u2019s anything you\u2019d like to add or adjust, let me know.  ",
          "2. **Schedule the root\u2011cause audit** \u2013 I\u2019ll have our technical lead reach out to you by tomorrow to set a date.  ",
          "3. **Set up the monthly health check\u2011ins** \u2013 I\u2019ll add a recurring calendar invite for the first session next week.  ",
          "4. **Apply the service credit** \u2013 Once the SLA is in place, we\u2019ll issue the credit automatically.",
          "",
